 <Picture 1>, identified as Elon Musk, remains fully consistent with the reference image in facial appearance, hairstyle, body proportions, clothing, colors, and overall identity. He stands on a scenic stone pathway at Henan Wansui Mountain Scenic Area, surrounded by layered mountain ridges, traditional-style scenic architecture, trees, and visitors moving naturally in the background. The composition, subject position, lighting direction, and major visual elements from <Picture 1> remain stable. The camera begins with a medium-wide shot and slowly pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed as Elon Musk looks around with curiosity, briefly turns toward the mountain scenery, and takes several relaxed steps along the pathway. Around the middle of the shot, he raises one hand in a natural gesture toward the scenic area while maintaining a calm, interested expression. The camera gently tracks beside him, preserving his identity, clothing, and spatial relationship with the surrounding architecture. Near the end, he pauses beside a traditional-style viewing point, looks toward the distant mountain landscape, then turns slightly toward the camera with a small friendly smile. Keep the movement natural and physically coherent, preserve the original reference-image appearance, avoid face distortion, avoid duplicated people, and do not add fictional logos, subtitles, dialogue, or political messaging.\n\noverall_soundscape: Natural outdoor ambience from the scenic area continues throughout, including light wind through the trees, distant visitor conversations, soft footsteps on the stone pathway, and occasional birdsong. Clothing fabric moves gently as he walks, with subtle ambient sounds from the surrounding traditional-style buildings and tourist activity.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A light cinematic travel score with soft Chinese bamboo flute, warm acoustic strings, and restrained hand percussion begins at a moderate tempo. The arrangement gradually becomes slightly fuller as t